दिया है।।","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"हे इस्राएल, अब से लेकर सदा सर्वदा यहोवा ही पर आशा लगाए रह!","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/HINIRV/PSA/131.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/HINIRV/PSA/132.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/HINIRV/PSA/130.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":3}